  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Public Sector Efficiency and Green Recovery DPL</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The development objective of the Public Sector Efficiency and Green Recovery Development Policy Loan in Serbia provides opportunities to contribute to sustainable growth and job creation by strengthening policies and institutions. Pillar 1, public sector efficiency and transparency contributes to improving the country&apos;s fiscal performance and social inclusion, and to accelerating private-sector-led growth post COVID-19. Pillar 2, efforts to initiate a green recovery, contribute to sustainable growth and an economy that is more resilient to future shocks, along the lines of the GRID Approach to promote Green, Resilient and Inclusive Development.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the proposed Public Sector Efficiency and Green Recovery Development Policy Loan is to support the Government of Serbia&apos;s efforts to: 1) increase public sector efficiency and transparency, and 2) initiate a green recovery.</narrative>
  </description>
